<!-- INTRO / HERO -->
<section class="section container reveal">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero__text">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">Hello there. I am...</p>
      <h1 class="hero__name">Jose Gaspar Marin</h1>
      <p class="hero__bio"><%= (settings && settings.status) || 'Editable bio from the admin panel here!' %></p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <% if (settings.github_url) { %>
          <a class="btn" href="<%= settings.github_url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        <% } %>
        <% if (settings.linkedin_url) { %>
          <a class="btn" href="<%= settings.linkedin_url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
        <% } %>
        <a class="btn" href="/resume">Resume</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__photo">
      <% if (settings.photo_hero) { %>
        <img src="/img/<%= settings.photo_hero %>" alt="Jose Gaspar Marin"
             style="border-radius:var(--radius);width:100%;max-width:360px;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;" />
      <% } else { %>
        <div class="placeholder"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg></div>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about" class="section container reveal">
  <h2 class="section__title">About</h2>
  <div class="about__grid">
    <div>
      <h3 class="about__lead">Nice to meet you.</h3>
      <% if (settings.photo_about_1) { %>
        <img src="/img/<%= settings.photo_about_1 %>" alt="About"
             style="border-radius:var(--radius);width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;" />
      <% } else { %>
        <div class="placeholder"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg></div>
      <% } %>
    </div>
    <div class="about__body">
      <p>I'm Jose Gaspar Marin, a Computer Science graduate from Southern Connecticut State University, born and raised in New Haven, CT.</p>
      <p>I have 5 years of experience in IT, working as an IT Technical Support Engineer at SCSU. I have resolved 1,300+ support tickets, deploying and managing Windows and macOS devices university-wide, and built internal tools that made the team more effective.</p>
      <p>Outside of IT, I build full-stack web applications. My capstone project, CS Library, is a real library management system slated for deployment at SCSU. I'm now looking for my next opportunity in software engineering or IT.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="about__grid about__grid--flip" style="margin-top: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);">
    <div>
      <h3 class="about__lead">A little more about me!</h3>
      <% if (settings.photo_about_2) { %>
        <img src="/img/<%= settings.photo_about_2 %>" alt="Personal"
             style="border-radius:var(--radius);width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;" />
      <% } else { %>
        <div class="placeholder"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg></div>
      <% } %>
    </div>
    <div class="about__body">
      <p>I've always had passion for technology and computers for as long as I can remember. I knew that it was something that I wanted to do when I grew up. </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROJECTS -->
<section id="projects" class="section container reveal">
  <h2 class="section__title">Projects</h2>

  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__media">
      <img src="/img/project1.png" alt="Home Page of CS Library">
      <h3 class="project__title"><a href="https://github.com/JoseG320/CS_Library_Nuc_Project" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CS Library</a></h3>
      <p class="project__desc">a library cataloging system</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project__body">
      <p>CS Library was a senior capstone project I took part in, built as a 3-person team. Our client was the Department of Computer Science at Southern Connecticut State Univerisity. We were tasked with a solution to replace the manual checkout system the CS library used.</p>
      <p>We built a student-facing web portal, a kiosk interface for a Raspberry Pi, and a full admin toolset. We also integrated Microsoft OAuth single sign-on and wired the separate Raspberry Pi checkout kiosk to the server via a shared-key REST API.</p>
      <p>This was built on Express.js, TypeScript, Drizzle ORM, PostgreSQL, and Docker. It will be maintained by the SCSU Computer Science Department going forward.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__media">
      <img src="/img/project2.png" alt="Dashboard of Sentinel, with a camera feed up and running.">
      <h3 class="project__title"><a href="https://github.com/JoseG320/sentinel" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sentinel</a></h3>
      <p class="project__desc">a zone-aware security system</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project__body">
      <p>Privacy and security is something I take extremely seriously. It's a fundamental right that we should all have in all scopes, especially home security. The thing is... Solutions for that are expensive, locked behind subscriptions, and are difficult to self-host and maintain.</p>
      <p>Sentinel is my answer to that. Built with a team member, Sentinel is a low cost and easy to use system that detects people in real time from camera streams and matches detections against user-defined "smart zones" with configurable alert levels.</p>
      <p>This was built with Python, FastAPI, Google Cloud Vision API, and a Streamlit dashboard with role-based access control and live event logging, all backed by PostgreSQL.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__media">
      <img src="/img/project3.png" alt="Echo, where you can add your favorite songs to share.">
      <h3 class="project__title"><a href="https://github.com/JoseG320/Echo-php" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Echo</a></h3>
      <p class="project__desc">a music comparator app</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project__body">
      <p>I love music. Music is everything to me. When I connected with a teammate </p>
      <p>That is how Echo was made and who it was made for. Echo is a social music-library web app where users manage playlists, browse other users' libraries, and compare profiles to find songs in common. It was my first project with a relational database schema, and it includes secure hashed-password authentication and an admin panel.</p>
      <p>This application was built with PHP, MySQL, Apache, and Docker. I'd love to expand it into a full-fledged application someday. The comparison feature, fostering an online connection using music, has a lot of potential.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
  <!--
  Use for the extra project page.
  <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:3rem;">
    <a class="btn" href="/projects">View More of My Work</a>
  </div>
  -->

  <!--
  Then uncomment the projects route in public and create projects.ejs like this:

  <section class="section container">
  <h1 class="section__title">Projects</h1>
  <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);margin-top:-1rem;margin-bottom:3rem;">
    Everything I have built.
  </p>

  Add future projects here using the same article.project structure

  </section>

  -->
</section>

<!-- CONTACT -->
<section id="contact" class="section container reveal">
  <h2 class="section__title">Contact</h2>
  <div class="contact__grid">
    <div>
      <h3 class="contact__lead">Let's work together.</h3>
      <div class="contact__text">
        <p>I'm always open to work. Whether that's a job, a freelance project, or a collaboration. If you think we'd work well together, I'd love to hear from you. Fill out the form to reach out to me!</p>
        <p>I'm also free to talk about anything other than opportunities. If you want to talk to me about video games, music, a hobby you are working on, or just want to say hi, reach out!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <form class="form" action="/contact" method="post">
      <% if (typeof csrfToken !== 'undefined') { %><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>" /><% } %>
      <div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave blank<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></div>
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required />
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required />
      <input type="text" name="subject" placeholder="Subject" />
      <textarea name="message" placeholder="Message" required></textarea>
      <div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="<%= turnstileSiteKey %>"></div>
      <button class="btn" type="submit" id="contact-submit" disabled>Submit</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
